#: index.docbook:168 index.docbook:178 index.docbook:188
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Note:"
msgstr "टीका:"

#: index.docbook:168
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are exceptions to this rule. In the traditional game of Mahjong each "
"tile has a matching one except for the <quote>Flowers</quote> and "
"<quote>Seasons</quote> tiles."
msgstr ""
"अस्य नियमस्य अपवादाः सन्ति । महजोङ्गस्य पारम्परिकक्रीडायां प्रत्येकस्य "
"टाइल् इत्यस्य <quote>पुष्पाणि</quote> तथा <quote>ऋतु</quote> टाइल् इत्येतौ "
"विहाय एकः मेलयुक्तः भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:174
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Flowers</quote> tiles have no doubles in the set and can be "
"matched directly to each other."
msgstr ""
"<quote>Flowers</quote> टाइल्स् इत्यस्य सेट् मध्ये द्विगुणाः नास्ति, तेषां "
"प्रत्यक्षतया परस्परं मेलनं कर्तुं शक्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:175
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <quote>Seasons</quote> tiles have no doubles in the set and can be "
"matched directly to each other."
msgstr ""
"<quote>ऋतुः</quote> टाइल्-समूहे समुच्चये द्विगुणाः नास्ति, तेषां "
"प्रत्यक्षतया परस्परं मेलनं कर्तुं शक्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:176
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Tiles can only be removed if they can be connected with a maximum of three "
"connected lines that do not cross any other tile. Lines can be horizontal "
"or vertical, but not diagonal."
msgstr ""
"टाइल्स् केवलं तदा एव निष्कासयितुं शक्यन्ते यदा ते अधिकतमं त्रीणि "
"सम्बद्धरेखाभिः सह संयोजितुं शक्यन्ते ये अन्यं टाइल् न लङ्घयन्ति । रेखाः "
"क्षैतिजः लम्बवत् वा भवितुम् अर्हन्ति, परन्तु तिर्यक् न ।"

#: index.docbook:178
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You do not have to draw the lines by yourself, the game does this for you. "
"Just mark two matching tiles on the board, if they can be connected by a "
"line with at most two bends, the line is drawn and the tiles are removed."
msgstr ""
"भवता स्वयमेव रेखाः आकर्षितुं न प्रयोजनम्, क्रीडा भवतः कृते एतत् करोति। "
"केवलं फलकस्य उपरि द्वौ मेलयुक्तौ टाइल् चिह्नितव्यम्, यदि ते अधिकतमं द्वौ "
"मोचनौ युक्तया रेखायाः माध्यमेन संयोजितुं शक्यन्ते तर्हि रेखा आकृष्यते, "
"टाइल्स् च निष्कासितानि भवन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:182
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Lines may only cross empty areas of the board."
msgstr "रेखाः केवलं फलकस्य रिक्तक्षेत्राणि एव लङ्घयितुं शक्नुवन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:183
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some games are unsolvable. If you would like to avoid unsolvable games "
"check the option <guilabel>Create solvable games only</guilabel> in the "
"configuration dialog."
msgstr ""
"केचन क्रीडाः असमाधानीयाः भवन्ति। यदि भवान् असमाधानीयक्रीडां परिहरितुम् "
"इच्छति तर्हि विन्याससंवादे <guilabel>केवलं समाधानयोग्यं क्रीडां "
"रचयतु</guilabel> इति विकल्पं पश्यतु ।"

#: index.docbook:184
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The scores are awarded for the time the player needs to remove all the "
"tiles from the game board. Games with more tiles give more scores."
msgstr ""
"यदा खिलाडयः क्रीडाफलकात् सर्वाणि टाइल्स् हर्तुं प्रवृत्तः भवति तस्य समयस्य "
"कृते स्कोराः प्रदत्ताः भवन्ति । अधिकानि टाइल्स् युक्ताः क्रीडाः अधिकं "
"स्कोरं ददति।"

#: index.docbook:185
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you played with the <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> setting enabled, the "
"score will be doubled."
msgstr ""
"यदि भवान् <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> सेटिङ्ग् सक्षमं कृत्वा क्रीडति तर्हि "
"स्कोरः द्विगुणः भविष्यति ।"

#: index.docbook:186
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To be eligible for a place amongst the high scores player has to complete a "
"game instance within the shortest period of time possible."
msgstr ""
"उच्चाङ्कप्राप्तानाम् मध्ये स्थानं प्राप्तुं योग्यतां प्राप्तुं खिलाडयः "
"अल्पतमसमये एव एकं क्रीडादृष्टान्तं सम्पन्नं कर्तव्यं भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:188
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the player uses the <quote>Undo</quote> or <quote>Hint</quote> feature "
"the record will not be considered as a high score."
msgstr ""
"यदि खिलाडी <quote>Undo</quote> अथवा <quote>Hint</quote> इति विशेषतायाः "
"उपयोगं करोति तर्हि अभिलेखः उच्चाङ्कः इति न गण्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:191
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tips"
msgstr "संकेता"

#: index.docbook:192
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on a tile with the &RMB; to highlight all matching tiles on the "
"board. Unlike using the <quote>Undo</quote> or <quote>Hint</quote> feature, "
"this help is allowed without being considered cheating."
msgstr ""
"&RMB; फलकस्य उपरि सर्वाणि मेलयुक्तानि टाइल्स् प्रकाशयितुं । "
"<quote>Undo</quote> अथवा <quote>Hint</quote> इति विशेषतायाः उपयोगात् "
"विपरीतम्, एषा सहायता वञ्चना इति न मन्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:200
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Interface Overview"
msgstr "अन्तरफलक अवलोकन"

#: index.docbook:203
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Menu Items"
msgstr "मेनू आइटम"

#: index.docbook:205
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Game Menu"
msgstr "गेम मेनू इति"

#: index.docbook:207
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Game</guimenu> menu lets you control the status of the current "
"game:"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> मेन्यू वर्तमानक्रीडायाः स्थितिं नियन्त्रयितुं "
"शक्नोति:"

#: index.docbook:214
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu><guimenuitem>नव</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:219
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Finishes the current game</action> and starts a new session with "
"new tiles."
msgstr ""
"<action>वर्तमानं क्रीडां समाप्तं करोति</action> नूतन-टाइल्-सहितं नूतनं "
"सत्रं च आरभते ।"

#: index.docbook:224
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>F5</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Restart Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>F5</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu><guimenuitem>खेलं पुनः आरभत</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:229
#. Tag: action
#, no-c-format
msgid "Restarts the current game with the same tiles."
msgstr "वर्तमानक्रीडां समानैः टाइल्-सहितं पुनः आरभते ।"

#: index.docbook:234
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Pause</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu><guimenuitem>विराम</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:239
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Pauses the game</action>, especially the timer which affects the "
"scoring. The menu entry is also used for resuming the game."
msgstr ""
"<action>क्रीडां विरामयति</action>, विशेषतः समयनिर्धारकः यः स्कोरिंग् "
"प्रभावितं करोति । मेनू-प्रविष्टिः क्रीडायाः पुनः आरम्भार्थम् अपि उपयुज्यते ।"

#: index.docbook:244
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Show High Scores</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu><guimenuitem>उच्चाङ्कान् दर्शयतु</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:249
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Shows your top ten charts of &kshisen;."
msgstr "&kshisen; इत्यस्य भवतः शीर्षदश चार्ट्स् दर्शयति।"

#: index.docbook:254
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu><guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu><guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:259
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &kshisen;."
msgstr "<कर्म>त्यजति</action> &kshisen;."

#: index.docbook:264
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Some of the menu items can also be controlled by keyboard shortcuts. See "
"<xref linkend=\"key-bindings\"/> for a list."
msgstr ""
"केचन मेनू-वस्तूनि कीबोर्ड-शॉर्टकट्-द्वारा अपि नियन्त्रयितुं शक्यन्ते । "
"सूचीं कृते <xref linkend=\"key-bindings\"/> पश्यन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:272
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Move Menu"
msgstr "The Move Menu इति"

#: index.docbook:277
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>चल</guimenu><guimenuitem>पूर्ववर्ती</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:282
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Undoes the last step</action>. Same as the "
"<guibutton>Undo</guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<action>अन्तिमपदं पूर्ववर्तयति</action> । साधनपट्ट्यां "
"<guibutton>Undo</guibutton> इति बटन् इव ।"

#: index.docbook:287
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Redo</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;&Shift;<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>चल</guimenu><guimenuitem>पुनः कुरुत</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:292
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Redoes the last step</action>. Same as the "
"<guibutton>Redo</guibutton> button in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"<action>अन्तिमपदं पुनः करोति</action> । साधनपट्ट्यां <guibutton>पुनः "
"कुर्वन्तु</guibutton> इति बटन् इव ।"

#: index.docbook:297
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo><keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>चल</guimenu><guimenuitem>संकेत</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:302
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Shows a hint</action>, which two tiles to remove next."
msgstr "<action>एकं संकेतं दर्शयति</action>, यत् द्वौ टाइलौ अग्रे निष्कासितव्यम् ।"

#: index.docbook:310
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "The Settings Menu"
msgstr "सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू इति"

#: index.docbook:315
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Play Sounds</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>ध्वनयः वादयन्तु</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:319
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Plays a sound when you touch a tile by clicking with it the &LMB; and when "
"a tile is falling down playing with <guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> enabled."
msgstr ""
"यदा भवन्तः टाइल् स्पृशन्ति तदा तेन सह &LMB; तथा च यदा "
"<guilabel>Gravity</guilabel> सक्षमं कृत्वा क्रीडन् टाइल् अधः पतति ।"

#: index.docbook:325
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kshisen;…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem>&kshisen;…</guimenuitem> "
"विन्यस्यताम्"

#: index.docbook:329
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Opens the <link linkend=\"configuration\">configuration dialog</link> to "
"change &kshisen; settings."
msgstr ""
"उद्घाटयति<link linkend=\"configuration\"> विन्याससंवादः</link> परिवर्तनं "
"कर्तुं &amp;kshisen; सेटिंग्स् इति ।"

#: index.docbook:333
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &kshisen; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> and "
"<guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the sections "
"about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &kshisen; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेनु< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

